ent-FlaskBase = { ent-SolutionSmall }
    .desc = { ent-DrinkBaseMaterialStrongMetal.desc }
ent-DrinkFlaskOld = 舊酒壺 | old flask
    .desc = 一個破舊的老酒壺，蓋子似乎遺失了。 | A decrepit old flask, its lid seems to be missing.
ent-DrinkShinyFlask = 閃亮的水壺 | shiny flask
    .desc = 一個閃亮的金屬水壺。上面似乎刻著一個希臘符號。 | A shiny metal flask. It appears to have a Greek symbol inscribed on it.
ent-DrinkMREFlask = MRE 水壺 | MRE flask
    .desc = 一只舊軍用水壺，裝滿了專為士兵準備的頂級飲品。 | An old military flask, filled with the finest contents for soldiers.
    .suffix = Full
ent-DrinkDetFlask = 檢查員的水壺 | inspector's flask
    .desc = 一個纏有皮帶並綴有金色徽章的金屬酒壺，屬於那位督察。 | A metal flask with a leather band and golden badge belonging to the inspector.
ent-DrinkHosFlask = 霍斯的酒壺 | hos's flask
    .desc = 一款金屬水壺，專為辛勤工作的部門主管而設計。 | A metal flask, fit for a hard working HoS.
ent-DrinkFlask = 船長的水壺 | captain's flask
    .desc = 一個屬於船長的金屬酒壺。 | A metal flask belonging to the captain.
ent-DrinkFlaskBar = 水壺 | flask
    .desc = 一款可重複使用的金屬水壺。比直接從瓶子裡喝更顯格調。 | A reusable metal flask. Classier than drinking straight from a bottle.
ent-DrinkLithiumFlask = 鋰瓶 | lithium flask
    .desc = 一個瓶子上印有鋰原子符號。 | A flask with a Lithium Atom symbol on it.
ent-DrinkVacuumFlask = 保溫瓶 | vacuum flask
    .desc = 自 1892 年以來，始終為您的飲品維持完美溫度。 | Keeping your drinks at the perfect temperature since 1892.
